On a slightly different note; I needed to connect my digital piano to my 
laptop the other day, but the laptop had no MIDI interface. So I tried 
connecting it through USB, because the piano had a USB port too. I knew 
it required a 3rd party driver on Windows, so I didn't expect much.

It just worked. :-)

 From someone who knows that fixing hardware often takes a lot of effort 
and hard work, I just wanted to shout a "thank you" and a "keep up the 
good work" to all contributors! :-)

